{{also|Forget}}
==English==
{{wp|forgetting}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰed-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|forgeten}}, {{m|enm|forgiten}}, {{m|enm|foryeten}}, {{m|enm|forȝiten}}, from {{inh|en|ang|forġietan||to forget}} [influenced by Old Norse {{m|non|geta}} ("to get, to guess")], from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*fragetan||to give up, forget}}. Equivalent to {{af|en|for-|get}}.

Cognate with :
* {{cog|sco|forget}}, {{m|sco|forȝet||to forget}},
* {{cog|fy|fergette}}, {{m|fy|ferjitte}}, {{m|fy|forjitte||to forget}},
* {{cog|nl|vergeten||to forget}},
* {{cog|de|vergessen||to forget}}.

